  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed boundary enclosure, by reason of its height, extent and scale, would be a visually intrusive and incongruous form of development, out of keeping with the prevailing character of development locally and harmful to the current open aspect and character of the wider streetscene.  As a result, the proposed development contradicts the Havering Local Plan (adopted 2021), the London Plan (2021), and the Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (2011).",
