  "description": "The building and installation of automated electric sliding gates creating an in and out driveway effect in order to increase security. This proposal is 1655mm from ground to top of wall pillar with the gate and railing height being 1501mm. The current wall that is already in situ does not exceed 1000mm in height. This proposal aims to increase the overall height to be 1655mm. The proposal does not pose any negative effects on neighbours and remains in keeping with other properties opposite and down the street with automated electric gates.",
